      "content": "hey im one type 1 and just ate a huge bowl of pasta like 120g carbs... im kinda panicking cuz my blood sugar is creeping up. my doctor told me to use my ratio but i forgot what it was. if i use 1 unit for every 5g of carbs i'll be fine right? i think i need like 25 units to cover this? just want to make sure im doing the math right so i dont crash later.",
